    "text": "<math><mn>0.7</mn></math>&nbsp;grams of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math> were dissolved in water and the volume was made to 100 mL, 20 mL of this solution required 19.8 mL of N/10 HCl for complete neutralization. The value of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math> is\r<br>\rReport your answer by rounding it upto nearest whole number."
